  "title": "Fine at Five",
  "summary": "Tess builds a timeline. Between 5 pm and 9:10 pm, when Glen found June, nobody accounts for anything. Paul Comeau, the town pharmacist June trained, sends warm condolences and offers to pull her records, mentioning he last saw her \"the week before\". Glen says he was at the curling bonspiel in Chester all evening and forwards the results to help.",
