          "text": "2. About 5:00 \"fine at 5,\" per the texter. Margo saw the pharmacy delivery around suppertime."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "3. Glen at the bonspiel in Chester \"all evening.\" Home about 9:10, found her. 911 at 9:12."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "4. Cellar light was off when Glen found her. That's in the police notes, not the obituary."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "5. Medical examiner: a fall on the cellar stairs, \"some hours\" before she was found."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "So from 5 to 9:10 nobody knows anything. Except whoever has her phone."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "kofi",
          "text": "Or whoever had it before them"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "...Yes."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "kofi",
          "text": "\"Fine at 5\" isn't a guess. Someone saw her or read something"
        }
